ues for GPIO port. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">uint32_t<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#sl-hal-gpio-get-port-output\">sl_hal_gpio_get_port_output<\/a>(sl_gpio_port_t port)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Get current setting for a GPIO port data out register. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#sl-hal-gpio-toggle-pin\">sl_hal_gpio_toggle_pin<\/a>(const sl_gpio_t *gpio)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Toggle a single pin in GPIO port data out register. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#sl-hal-gpio-toggle-port\">sl_hal_gpio_toggle_port<\/a>(sl_gpio_port_t port, uint32_t pins)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Toggle pins in GPIO port data out register. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#sl-hal-gpio-enable-interrupts\">sl_hal_gpio_enable_interrupts<\/a>(uint32_t flags)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Enable one or more GPIO interrupts. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#sl-hal-gpio-disable-interrupts\">sl_hal_gpio_disable_interrupts<\/a>(uint32_t flags)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Disable one or more GPIO interrupts. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><di